Post-Endgame

Purpose

Post-Endgame is the final stage of the main technological progression.

This stage begins after UHV and represents technology beyond the conventional industrial tiers.

There is no single normal tier above UHV.

Instead, progression becomes focused on extreme production, rare materials, cross-mod integration, massive resource requirements, and long-term objectives.

The purpose of the Post-Endgame is to provide meaningful progression after the completion of conventional GregTech technology.

