Power

Post-endgame power requirements should exceed normal UHV production.

The player should be required to expand power generation significantly.

Multiple large-scale power systems may be combined.

Power distribution must support massive simultaneous production.

Energy storage and stabilization become important for maintaining continuous production.

The goal is to make power infrastructure itself part of the endgame challenge.

