GregTech Integration

GregTech provides the foundation for post-endgame industrial progression.

UHV materials and infrastructure become prerequisites for the most extreme recipes.

GregTech remains integrated with the other technological systems rather than becoming an isolated progression path.

Modern Industrialization Integration

Modern Industrialization provides additional high-end processing and industrial infrastructure.

MI materials and machinery can be incorporated into post-endgame recipes.

MI must remain complementary to the main progression.

Mekanism Integration

Mekanism provides advanced chemical processing, refining, energy infrastructure, and large-scale industrial systems.

Mekanism can become increasingly important for extreme resource processing.

Its most powerful systems must remain gated behind the main progression.

AE2 Integration

AE2 becomes a major component of endgame logistics.

Large-scale storage systems

Automated crafting

Complex processing networks

Resource distribution

Factory control

Massive item logistics

AE2 should become increasingly important as the number of required resources and production chains increases.

Create Aeronautics Integration

Create Aeronautics can provide advanced transportation and large-scale mechanical infrastructure.

Airships and other systems can become part of exploration, logistics, and endgame infrastructure.

Its progression must remain integrated with the overall technology tree.

Create Big Cannons Integration

Create Big Cannons provides advanced weaponry and industrial artillery systems.

Its most powerful equipment can be gated behind late-game materials and infrastructure.

Combat progression should complement technological progression without replacing it.

ProjectE Integration

ProjectE is post-endgame content.

ProjectE must not provide unrestricted resource duplication during the main progression.

Access to ProjectE requires a major post-endgame milestone.

Transmutation, EMC generation, and Energy Condensers must be individually gated.

ProjectE should represent the transition from industrial production into extreme resource manipulation.

Avaritia Integration

Avaritia is one of the final progression systems.

Avaritia equipment and components must require materials from multiple technological systems.

Extreme Crafting recipes should combine resources from throughout the entire progression.

Avaritia should represent the final crafting challenge of the pack.

