Final Milestone

The final milestone represents the completion of the entire technological ecosystem.

The player must have completed the major industrial progression.

The player must have established extreme-scale automation.

The player must have completed the major ProjectE progression.

The player must have completed the major Avaritia progression.

The player must have obtained the rarest resources.

The player must have completed the major exploration objectives.

The player must have completed the major magical objectives.

The player must have integrated the major technological systems.

The final milestone should require resources and infrastructure from the entire modpack.

Post-endgame is complete only when the player has effectively mastered the entire progression system.

The objective is not simply to obtain the strongest item.

The objective is to build an industrial ecosystem capable of producing the strongest items in the pack.
